@startuml
title GPU Telemetry Pipeline

participant DataSource as DS
participant Streamer
participant "Message Queue" as MQ
participant Collector
database PostgreSQL
participant "API Server" as API

== Ingestion ==

Streamer -> DS : Read and process data
Streamer -> MQ : Enqueue telemetry data

== Consumption ==

Collector -> MQ : Poll message
MQ --> Collector : Telemetry message

note right of Collector
  Poll-based consumption
  Collector controls throughput
end note

== Processing & Acknowledgement ==

Collector -> PostgreSQL : Persist telemetry (transaction)

alt Persistence succeeds
    PostgreSQL --> Collector : Commit OK
    Collector -> MQ : Ack message
    note right of Collector
      Message removed from queue
      only after successful commit
    end note

else Persistence fails OR Collector crashes
    PostgreSQL --> Collector : Error / No response
    note right of Collector
      No acknowledgment sent
    end note

    note right of MQ
      Message remains unacknowledged
      Eligible for redelivery
      according to queue semantics
    end note
end

== Query ==

API -> PostgreSQL : Query telemetry
PostgreSQL --> API : Results

note right of API
  Read-only access
  No direct queue interaction
end note

@enduml
